    p['budget']=dict(aggregate_CPU_seconds=600,wall_seconds=900,GPUs=0,max_memo_states_total=2000000,max_split_evaluations_total=50000000,max_integer_bits=100000,membership_calls=32768,planned_cases=4096,new_positive_appearances=0,historical_positive_appearances=32768,enforcement='All tree memo entries AND Huffman bound memo entries AND counterfactual nodes charge states. Canonical tree partition evaluations AND Huffman merges AND counterfactual MAP partitions charge the50M work-step counter, named global_split_evaluations for continuity. Reference/pruned/cache runtime gate work, CPU/wall, preparation, serialization, sourcehash checking, postexecution evaluation and monitoring all charged. Canonical computation reuse charges zero new memo/work but its complete proof/input/result serialization and hash validation still charge CPU/wall. Logical proof counts and actual charged counts separately reported. Same600CPU/900wall,2Mstate/50Mwork limits; no promised completion or cap-as-infeasibility. Any cap/error makes the WHOLE4096case study incomplete; no budget extension, continued prefix or reduced-scope endpoint.')
